    },
    {
      "title": "Settler Siege of Palestinian Homes Highlights Growing West Bank Chaos",
      "link": "https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/12/world/middleeast/west-bank-palestinians-israeli-settlers.html",
      "description": "Two families have been trapped by settlers for days, casting a spotlight on the army’s struggle to curtail settler violence and protect Palestinians living in the occupied West Bank.",
